fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gstjpegparser.html#gst_jpeg_get_default_huffman_tables","fragment":"\n\tgst_jpeg_get_default_huffman_tables\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.prototype.jpeg_get_default_huffman_tables\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.jpeg_get_default_huffman_tables\n\nFills in huf_tables with the default AC/DC Huffman tables, as\nspecified by the JPEG standard.\nParameters:\nThe default DC/AC Huffman tables to fill in\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.6\n\t\t\nFills in huf_tables with the default AC/DC Huffman tables, as\nspecified by the JPEG standard.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.6\n\t\t\nFills in huf_tables with the default AC/DC Huffman tables, as\nspecified by the JPEG standard.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.6\n\t\t\n"});